<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    <p>Find quick answers to common questions about orders, shipping, returns, and more.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container page-content">

  {%- if page.content != blank -%}
    <div style="max-width:720px; margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-lg);">{{ page.content }}</div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="faq-list">

    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">Orders &amp; Shipping</h2>
    <div class="product-accordion" style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>How do I place an order?</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p>Simply browse our collections, add items to your cart, and proceed to checkout. We accept all major credit cards, PayPal, Shop Pay, and more.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Do you offer free shipping?</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p>Yes! We offer free shipping on qualifying orders over $50 within the contiguous US. Expedited and international shipping options are available at checkout.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>How long will it take to receive my order?</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p>Standard orders ship within 1–3 business days. Once shipped, domestic delivery typically takes 3–7 business days. You'll receive a tracking number by email.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Can I track my order?</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p>Absolutely. Once your order ships you'll receive an email with a tracking link. You can also view your order history in your account dashboard.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">Returns &amp; Exchanges</h2>
    <div class="product-accordion" style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What is your return policy?</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p>We accept returns within 30 days of delivery for unused items in their original packaging. To start a return, please <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact" style="color:var(--color-accent);">contact us</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>How do I exchange an item?</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p>Contact our team with your order number and the item you'd like to exchange. We'll confirm availability and guide you through the process.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What if my item arrived damaged?</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p>We're so sorry! Please contact us within 7 days of delivery with a photo of the damage. We'll arrange a replacement or refund right away — no return required.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">Products &amp; Safety</h2>
    <div class="product-accordion">
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Are your products safe for pets?</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p>Yes. Every product we carry is reviewed for pet safety. We only stock non-toxic, pet-safe products from reputable manufacturers. When in doubt, check the product description or contact our team.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>How do I choose the right size for my pet?</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          <p>Each product page includes a size guide where applicable. If you're unsure, our team is happy to help — just <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact" style="color:var(--color-accent);">contact us</a> with your pet's breed, weight, and measurements.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div><!-- /.faq-list -->

  <div style="text-align:center; margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);">
    <p style="opacity:0.7; margin-bottom:1rem;">Still have questions?</p>
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</div>
